2026-11-07T11:51:11.5383171Z I will:
2026-11-07T11:51:11.5383369Z 
2026-11-07T11:51:11.5383509Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
2026-11-07T11:51:11.5383807Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
2026-11-07T11:51:11.5384319Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
2026-11-07T11:51:11.5384773Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
2026-11-07T11:51:11.5385057Z  - install Nix in /nix
2026-11-07T11:51:11.5385255Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
2026-11-07T11:51:11.5385549Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
2026-11-07T11:51:11.5385824Z    /root
2026-11-07T11:51:11.5396891Z  - back up /etc/bash.bashrc to /etc/bash.bashrc.backup-before-nix
2026-11-07T11:51:11.5397309Z  - update /etc/bash.bashrc to include some Nix configuration
2026-11-07T11:51:11.5407296Z  - load and start a service (at /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.service
2026-11-07T11:51:11.5407720Z    and /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.socket) for nix-daemon
2026-11-07T11:51:11.5407932Z 
2026-11-07T11:51:11.5409423Z [32m[4;32mReady to continue?
2026-11-07T11:51:11.5409811Z [0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
